{"route": "cv_question", "lang": "en", "answer": "AgentBrain is a private project of Christopher's, running since 10/2026. It is a multi-agent system built on Claude Code. An Obsidian vault holds the notes, and a manager agent hands tasks to ten specialist agents, for example for video, development, research, career and design. The system has shared memory, skills and MCP servers.

It also has a local vault search that runs in one call and combines keywords, vectors and a link graph. In his own test with 187 questions, it was 49 % cheaper than his previous search at the same answer quality. The agents use cloud models; only the search runs locally.

AgentBrain is separate from his work at DATEV. He uses Claude Code daily in this project, and Claude Code is not part of his job there.", "tool_calls": [], "show_form": false}
